WEBVTT

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.090
<i>For generations,</i>

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:10.100
the Sirius tribe enshrined
and worshiped the Chosen One

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.060
as an agent of God,
chosen from the Royal House by the Oracle.

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.560
And as proof of his reign,

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.110
the King was allowed to possess a chest,
said to have been received from God,

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:21.440
that has the power
to control all things in the universe.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:24.320
That chest is what is called
"the Ark of Sirius."

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.240
Is this the grave of that Royal Family?

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:32.910
Yeah. There's nothing to indicate
that this place has been tampered with.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:35.750
Didn't the Vampires notice it?

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:38.630
Since the Ark was not
in the alter out front,

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:41.550
they must have thought
this was only a grave.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.970
But if my interpretation
of the ancient documents are correct...

00:00:57.940 --> 00:00:58.770
Professor?

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:13.580
What's this?

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.710
This was built mimicking
the Sirius tribe's sanctuary,

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.420
so in a sense it's a separated sanctuary.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:20.880
Sanctuary?

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:24.340
It is said to be
the Sirius tribe's birthplace,

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.470
as well as where the Ark was created.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.720
And it's also known as the only place
to seal the Ark.

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.850
Then the true sanctuary is...

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:35.060
Presumably, it's in southern Sakhalin.

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:38.060
In the past,

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:40.900
they had to leave the sanctuary
for some reason...

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.780
So, to move the Ark from the sanctuary,

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:46.150
they say a paired treasure was created.

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:49.820
This is the hidden alter to enshrine it.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:53.700
Here, we should find what the possessors
of the Ark have created,

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:55.660
what only true successors can know.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:01.840
"This vessel is realized
by unknown skills.

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:07.130
Its power relieves the Godly Ark
and directs it to that land."

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:12.010
As expected, it's here.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.440
If the seal of the Ark is to be broken
in the true sanctuary,

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:29.030
Yuliy must need this now.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:31.490
Get ready for departure.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:33.580
Awesome!

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:34.790
Let's hurry.

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:38.960
Oh, no. I thought we'd be able
to go home to London.

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:41.250
<i>Let's go. To be by Yuliy's side.</i>

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:35.410
Oh, I was waiting for you.

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:38.330
I was waiting a long, long time!

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.950
What are these guys? Are they Vampires?

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:42.580
Then I'll introduce myself.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:45.120
My name is Klarwein.

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:50.380
Some call me "Wizard" for my technology
often mistaken for magic,

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:53.720
but I am a respected
super genius scientist.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:58.140
A scientist!?
You made the Vampires mechanical?

00:04:58.390 --> 00:04:59.760
Oh, yes, yes.

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:02.930
The human experiment was successful
so now I did a mass production of it,

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:05.770
this time with Vampires.
Isn't it wonderful?

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:10.690
Now, let's begin the commemorative
mass production type practice test!

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.410
More were infected?

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.740
Yeah, a few were.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.870
It seems they are isolated
in the lowest section.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:27.000
No one wants to go near them,
fearing infection.

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:37.050
Yuliy.

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:43.270
What do you think
about my adorable honeys?

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:46.810
You know,
if they weren't remodeled like this,

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:48.190
they'd die.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.020
Are you intrigued? Are you?

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:54.610
I'll teach you,
the ignorant and uneducated.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:59.240
The Vampires are being inflicted
by a fatal disease now.

00:05:59.320 --> 00:06:01.910
The cause and source of infection
are unknown.

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:04.790
<i>Not knowing when they could be infected</i>
<i>by the mysterious disease,</i>

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:08.000
<i>the Vampires spend</i>
<i>sleepless nights in fear!</i>

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:11.540
<i>Oops! Vampires sleep during the day.</i>

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:13.710
Hey.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.010
<i>A fatal disease?</i>

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.050
For the Vampires?

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:22.470
Yes, not knowing what to do,
they came begging to me.

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:27.480
And yet, as soon as
Master Yevgraf found the Ark of Sirius,

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:30.730
he ditches my wonderful plan.

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:32.190
Isn't it cruel?

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:35.570
They believe they could manage the disease
with the Ark's power,

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:38.360
despite the fact
that they aren't even sure of what it is!

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:41.410
How foolish and unscientific!

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:44.950
Such a thing should be sealed forever.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:49.120
Then, the Vampires will realize
how wonderful my technology was

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:50.460
What is he saying?

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.380
-Bishop.
-and come depending on me!

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:57.340
So, to have my sweethearts approved
by Mister Yevgraf,

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.930
die here please!

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:20.570
My goodness! My goodness!

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.700
Stop running around so much, you mutts!

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:35.130
One more shot! Oh?

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:46.600
Bishop!

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:49.770
Wait a minute.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:53.020
How can my super genius
scientist's technology

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:55.270
become a lost technology like this?

00:07:57.150 --> 00:08:02.740
I... I won't accept this,
I'm not going to accept this!

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:14.120
So close! That was reckless.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:17.040
I knew you'd be able
to dodge the flames, Bishop.

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:18.880
Oh, how nice of you to say.

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:23.090
I'm anxious about what he said.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:28.220
Yeah, a fatal disease
that only infects Vampires.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:29.470
Finally,

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:32.980
they have no other choice but to rely
on an occult-like unknown power.

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:35.690
How pitiful.

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:39.730
Let's hurry.

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:46.780
Tamara, is the Ark of Sirius still asleep?

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:49.620
It'll be awake soon. Right, Master Yev?

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.700
Yes, it will.

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:56.250
What is it?

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:59.460
The isolated ones all died.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.130
The corpses didn't turn into ashes.
They're in their original form.

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:04.760
I see.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:08.930
Be very careful
when disposing the corpses.

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:11.560
-Yes, sir.
-Hey, Larisa.

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:15.060
If we get sick, too,
are we going to die like that?

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:18.860
Oh, no. No! That's like a human.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:19.900
Right, Master...

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:23.280
Can you leave me be?

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:35.830
<i>It's been a thousand years</i>
<i>since the blood pact has freed us</i>

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:38.540
<i>from the damned yoke of the humans.</i>

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:42.500
Having become Vampires
with powers of immortality,

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:45.630
we have ruled over everlasting time...

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:49.510
It was a blissful time for me.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.930
But this is how it all ends?

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:58.310
Was our blood this vulnerable?

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:03.270
Are we no different from those foolish
and livestock-like humans?

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:06.610
Like the senile old fools said,

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:09.950
are we to accept it as fate
and wait for doomsday?

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:15.040
Nay! I will continue to resist.

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:18.250
Even if I become the last Vampire.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:22.710
Even if that means using the powers
of the inferior Sirius!

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:28.130
<i>With these hands of mine,</i>
<i>and with my noble blood,</i>

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:29.880
<i>I will make a change!</i>

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:35.180
Is that it?

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:39.230
<i>So that's where I'll find...</i>
<i>The Ark of Sirius...</i>

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:42.150
<i>And Father.</i>

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:58.410
This is great.

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:02.420
The atmosphere sure feels like
the Ark is further down here...

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:05.920
I feel a really strong dangerous vibe.

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.060
Look at you, you waste no time!

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:33.070
Hey, what's wrong?

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:34.160
<i>Father.</i>

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:36.990
<i>Are you telling me not to come?</i>

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:50.380
Yuliy! Are you okay?

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:55.390
<i>I knew nothing...</i>

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:58.430
<i>about Father.</i>

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:01.020
<i>Nor about the tribe.</i>

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:04.940
<i>That's why as the survivor of Sirius,</i>

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.360
<i>I need to know everything.</i>

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:11.030
<i>Isn't that right, Father!?</i>

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:19.580
Yuliy!

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:40.140
<i>Mother...</i>

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.060
<i>Father...</i>

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:44.810
Father,

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:48.310
I will protect Yuliy and Mother!

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:25.690
This truly is a great place...

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:28.940
I feel as if I've returned to my homeland.

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:32.070
You saved my son's life.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:37.200
If you don't have anywhere to go,
I won't mind if you stayed here forever.

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:40.490
That's nice of you to say but...

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:42.490
Alexei.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:46.250
There's something I have to do.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:49.210
The Ark of Sirius?

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:50.590
Yeah.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:53.840
I have secret orders to find and steal it.

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:56.880
The search had been extremely difficult,

00:13:57.970 --> 00:14:00.430
but by coincidence,
I met you all, the Sirius.

00:14:01.430 --> 00:14:03.600
I'm sorry for keeping it
a secret until now.

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:05.980
I didn't mean to deceive you.

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:09.650
-What are you going to do?
-I don't know.

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:11.690
If I steal the Ark,

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:15.860
it will disrupt the peace in Dogville,
which I have come to love.

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:17.610
Akasaka...

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.950
But please know this.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.200
Now, not only Japan

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:25.750
but the powers of the world
are secretly searching for the Ark.

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:29.420
It's a matter of time
before they reach this village.

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:31.380
Alexei,

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:34.960
will you be able to protect the Ark then?

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:40.640
Why? He told me everything honestly.

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:42.220
Why Akasaka...?

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.720
Those who know of the Ark,

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:47.520
and those who make an attempt for it
shall be done away with,

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.230
along with their memories.

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:53.110
This is an ancient Sirius code.

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:57.360
To keep peace
for the Royal Family protecting the Ark,

00:14:57.530 --> 00:15:00.860
the Royal House attendants have enforced
that code for generations.

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:04.330
I have no personal grudges against
that man either.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:08.120
I understand that the Ark
is important to the tribe.

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:10.790
But is there anything worth protecting,

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:13.540
even if it means
sacrificing a person's life?

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:16.800
Even if we kill Akasaka,
someone else will come...

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:21.630
Do we have to repeat
such a futile thing each time?

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:27.520
No matter what hardships may come,
we live solitarily with the Ark.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:30.440
Because that is the pride of Sirius.

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:31.770
Pride?

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:35.020
Are you saying that
to keep on killing people

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:36.400
for the Ark is our pride?

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:38.990
The village accepted Sachi...

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:41.610
Accepted a human as my wife.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.780
And it's you who accepted her!

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:47.330
Coexisting with humans...

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:51.500
Isn't that the new pride of the Sirius?

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:55.040
So, why do something to regress?

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:57.750
Gustav.

00:15:58.710 --> 00:16:00.920
I want to seal the Ark of Sirius.

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:05.220
I want to end such a thing.

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:08.560
We will part with ancient traditions.

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:11.770
I think that'll be better
for the future of the Sirius.

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:13.730
So Gustav!

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:16.560
Teach me how to seal the Ark.

00:16:16.980 --> 00:16:18.230
But...

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:21.320
Please. This is the only way.

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:24.450
Gustav.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:27.830
Sakhalin.

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:31.660
It is the birthplace for us Sirius,

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:34.460
and also the sanctuary
where the Ark was created.

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:38.880
It may be possible to seal the Ark there.

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.710
-Then...
-However,

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:44.180
only the descendant
of the Royal House can do that.

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:47.140
In other words, only you can do it.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:53.100
It is said that by releasing the King's
soul and thus breaking the seal,

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:57.770
the Ark was once moved from the Sanctuary.

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:00.360
If you are to seal it again...

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:03.990
Alexei, there's no telling
what could happen to you.

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:08.570
Think hard
if you really want to seal the Ark,

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:12.370
even if it means putting yourself at risk.

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.420
-Father!
-Father!

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:29.890
<i>If they can go on living</i>
<i>with a new Sirius pride in their hearts...</i>

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:34.930
I'll be back as soon as I seal the Ark.

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:39.270
If you take too long
Yuliy will forget you.

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:41.400
That's not good.

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:44.110
You won't forget me will you?

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:45.700
Of course not.

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:51.450
Sachi, I'm sorry.

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:56.790
Silly man. Why are you apologizing?
You mean "I'm going." Right?

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.040
That's right.

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:11.140
Father.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.850
Father!

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:19.440
Father.

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:23.480
Father!

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:34.240
Yuliy.

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:42.670
Fa... Father.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:48.010
The things you wanted to know...
was that everything?

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:53.100
You understand now.
If you're satisfied, go home.

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:57.270
Wait, please.

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:01.560
Father... Will you always be like this?

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:06.530
The "seal" means
releasing the soul of the Ark's protector.

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:09.780
And my soul is with the seal.

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:12.320
You understand the meaning?

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:16.490
Then, Father, you'll keep being miserable!

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:19.830
After you left the village,

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:23.250
Dogville was attacked by Vampires
who were after the Ark.

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:26.380
Mother, Gustav, and everyone died.

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:32.130
Brother risked his life to protect me
but became a Vampire because of it.

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:35.810
For our happiness
and for the future of Sirius,

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:39.100
you risked your own life, Father...

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:40.770
How then,

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:44.810
could our story be such a cruel one?

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:47.150
That's why I'm miserable?

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.240
The sacrifice was great,

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:53.740
but by sealing the Ark,
the peace of the world has been kept...

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:56.200
It's peaceful now,
and will remain to be so.

00:19:56.830 --> 00:20:00.790
No matter what hardships may come,
we live solitarily with the Ark.

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:03.870
I should be
the only one carrying the burden

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:06.090
of parting with that
ancient pride of Sirius.

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:11.090
As a father I don't want you two
to carry this burden.

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.430
Please understand, Yuliy.

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:16.140
No, Father.

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:18.260
That's not it.

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:20.770
You are not wrong.

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:23.350
But that won't change anything!

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:26.480
Mother told me right before she died.

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:27.650
"Survive," she said.

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:30.110
Now I understand what that means.

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:35.490
She wanted me to survive
and do what you wanted to do.

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:37.200
Yuliy.

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:40.370
It is wrong for one
to have to sacrifice himself

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:42.620
for the happiness of others!

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:46.250
That's why I want to search

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:48.340
for another way
other than sealing the Ark.

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:51.920
I will survive...

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:56.510
I will survive to prove that
the new pride of Sirius

00:20:56.590 --> 00:20:58.550
you wanted to show was not wrong.

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:07.060
I didn't think the day would come
when I'd be preached

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:08.940
by that little boy I remember.

00:21:09.690 --> 00:21:12.440
It's thanks to both Mother and Mikhail.

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:16.910
Mother was about your grandness.
Brother was about your strength.

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:21.160
They both entrusted your intentions to me
and raised me.

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:23.040
I see.

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:29.920
Yuliy.

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:35.260
Maybe you could truly accomplish
what I could not.

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:37.930
Father.

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:40.680
Accept this.

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:49.310
Together with your mother,
I'll be watching you find the answer.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:53.280
Father!

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:00.660
What is it?

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:03.450
What is happening?

00:22:15.050 --> 00:22:17.930
-It's beginning, it's beginning!
-So, it's here.

00:22:18.180 --> 00:22:19.720
I longed for you...

00:22:20.640 --> 00:22:23.060
The Ark of Sirius!

00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:24.850
EPISODE 10
MEMORIES OF THE ABYSS

00:24:02.660 --> 00:24:03.780
<i>I'll end it on my own.</i>

00:24:03.860 --> 00:24:06.450
<i>Give me the Ark!</i>

00:24:06.530 --> 00:24:08.290
<i>Brother, wake up!</i>

00:24:08.370 --> 00:24:10.790
<i>-You should have never come here!</i>
<i>-You bastard!</i>

00:24:10.870 --> 00:24:11.910
EPISODE 11
CALLING IN BLOOD

00:24:21.920 --> 00:24:24.930
